   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Fine-art film with faintly green-olive shadows (~31,39,24), creamy neutral highlights, medium saturation (0.28), warm-natural skin (hue 28). Best for: Outdoor European-style venues, greenery and gardens, destination weddings in Italy/France/Goa, engagement sessions in nature. Greens stay elegant instead of neon.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
